window.products.push({"id":505049,"name":"Sophie Allport Double Oven Glove - Swallow Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VwV2+8McL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Protect your hands from hot pans with this lovely pair of heat resistant Double Oven Gloves in our fresh and summery Swallow design, part of the Swallow collection of kitchen textiles, fine bone china, oilcloth and stationery. Sophie has captured the elegant gliding and diving of the beautiful Swallow in this lovely pale sky blue fabric. A practical gift for getting those piping hot casseroles out of the oven and great for anyone who collects our Swallow range. The Double Oven Glove is 18cm x 84cm and is 100% cotton. The reverse of the Glove and inside each hand pocket there is a special heat resistant fabric. There is also a handy 'loop' in the middle of the glove so you can hang it up in your kitchen. Perhaps also consider a Swallow Tea Towel or a Swallow Apron for some co-ordinated cooking! Product Features: Part of the Sophie Allport Swallow collection.  Heat resistant.  Hanging loop.  100% cotton.  18cm x 84cm.  Machine washable. Please Note: It is our standard company policy that all customs fees are the responsibility of the customer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VwV2+8McL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sophie Allport","source_asin":"B00ITQFNJU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ITQFNJU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ITQFNJU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":505050,"name":"South Shore Summer Breeze Bed Set - Mates Bed and Bookcase Headboard kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":442.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MxSMWeQgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"South Shore Summer Breeze Bed Set - Mates Bed and Bookcase Headboard Kit Bed and headboard set Now here’s an affordable choice! This set includes a base for the bed with three large drawers, and a headboard with one shelf and five storage spaces… but you don’t need a box spring. Just put the mattress (not included) on the base and you’re good to go! This set is a wise choice for a kid’s room since it gives you lots of storage space in a classic Country style. Bookcase headboard Put your child’s favorite books on this shelf, which runs the length of the headboard. It can hold up to 25 pounds. The five open storage spaces, separated by fixed shelves, can hold stuffed toys, knick-knacks, a bedside lamp, and even electronics since there’s a hole for passing cords through in the back – a touch of genius! Everything will fit… and there’s a place for all of it! More storage space Aside from the bookcase headboard, this bed has three drawers that all go in on one side: either right or left, depending on the room layout. So this gives you all the space you need to keep the room tidy and put away seasonal items. AN OH-SO-VERSATILE COUNTRY STYLE: The nicely worked lines and large knob handles give this duo a Country bedroom look that blends easily with your decor. MAXIMUM STORAGE: This bed features three drawers and a headboard with a shelf and open spaces, for a ton of storage. Ideal for a kid’s or teen’s room!. AN AFFORDABLE COMBO: This bed and headboard set doesn’t need a box spring, so it’ll save you money! Just put the mattress (not included) on the base… and you’re done. A HOLE FOR PASSING CORDS THROUGH: No more struggling with cords – you have a hole in the back for passing them through, so you can hide the connections for electronics and accessories, such as a bedside lamp. 5-YEAR LIMITED WARRANTY: South Shore is proud to stand behind this bed set - mates bed and bookcase headbo","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MxSMWeQgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"South Shore","source_asin":"B09DZM9Z2R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DZM9Z2R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DZM9Z2R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
