window.products.push({"id":505126,"name":"Greaton 15-inch Adjustable Bed Frame with Decorative Fabrics | Head Inclining with Wired Remote, Protective Foot Retainer Bar, 12-inch Patented Screw-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":346.08,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Oq3acQaQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Choosing the right bed frame to rest completely is very important. Getting proper sleep will help you to work energetically throughout the whole day. Our bed frames ensure you get the needed sleep or rest every time! Our bed base frames are fitted with numerous helpful benefits that ensure you are comfortable and get the utmost rest whenever you lie down. The bed frames are built to perfection. These adjustable frames are made using top-quality components that can endure large amounts of load easily. The heavy-duty bed base legs help to support the frame and provide the needed stability. These bed bases support multiple mattresses like memory foam, latex, pocket coil, and air mattresses. You can easily pick your favorite mattress that best fits you to use with the bed frames! Our bed bases give you a new way to rest yourself or do whatever you want while being very comfortable! The multi-configurable frame will allow you to adjust the head section of the bed frame to the position you like. This will provide you with much-needed comfort and relaxation. You can easily click the Flat option on the wired remote to get your bed frame back to a flat position. This easy control makes your life easy and hassle-free. The bed base will let you watch your favorite TV shows, games, or movies while being very comfortable and relaxed. If you want to set the bed frame by yourself, You will not require special tools when setting up our bed bases! You can easily set up the whole bed frame by yourself without any problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Oq3acQaQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greaton","source_asin":"B084HC4TWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084HC4TWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084HC4TWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
