window.products.push({"id":505139,"name":"Lot45 Plastic Table Covers - 100ft x 52in Disposable Tablecloth Roll, Checkered Red and White Plastic Tablecloth Roll","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cJb90T57L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Use the Lot45 Thanksgiving Tablecloth Disposable Rectangle Plastic Table Covers to decorate and protect your floors, walls, countertops, and tables for any occasion. 4.3 x 100 feet (52 x 1200 inches) party tablecloth roll box feature a sliding cutter to allow you to cover any size table to prevent scratches, stains, spills, and general wear. 1.5 mil thick party table cloths disposable tablecloths have a soft, smooth texture making it easy to wipe away messes or to toss in the trash when finished. Choose between our red and white or blue and white disposable tablecloths. Great for birthday, graduation, and anniversary parties, barbecues and cookouts, restaurant and catering buffets, or family gatherings on the holidays. Oil and waterproof plastic is non-toxic and recyclable. PROTECT YOUR TABLES: Whether decorating or crafting, the Lot45 Checkered Tablecloths for Rectangle Tables, 52 IN by 100 FT Disposable Table Cover Roll provides an attractive barrier to protect your table and counter surfaces from wear and tear CONVENIENT SELF-CUTTER BOX: Plastic sliding edge cutter allows you to slice the exact length you need to cover any size table easily; Storage box shields material from dust CUSTOMIZABLE SIZING: Disposable table cloths rectangle party roll measures 4.3 x 100 feet (52 x 1200 inches/ 1.3 x 30.5m); 100 feet of plastic table cloths for parties can cover 12 individual 6-foot tables while ensuring enough overhang material FESTIVE DECOR FOR YOUR VENUE: Choose between our blue and white or red and white checkered gingham pattern to add color and cheer to any occasion; Perfect for camping, buffets, and family gatherings QUALITY PLASTIC TABLECLOTHS: Low density polyethylene plastic provides resistance to water and oil; 0.03mm-0.05mm (1.2-1.9mil) thick plastic table cloths rectangle table covers has a soft, smooth texture California Residents Prop 65 warning:Products may contain a chemical known to the State of California to cause cancer, birth defects or other reproductive harm. This product has a manufacturer warranty against defects in materials and workmanship for a period of ONE (1) YEAR from the date of original retail purchase. See our Seller Return Policy for more details.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cJb90T57L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lot45","source_asin":"B07WHL7KTX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WHL7KTX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WHL7KTX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":505140,"name":"Viewtainer Slit-Top Starter Set (Pastel)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iJREe55AL._AC_SL1226_.jpg","description":"CLEAR CANISTER STORAGE - Organizing your tools, crafts, and other items is great until you forget what is inside the container. Viewtainer’s clear canister style storage containers make it easy to see what is inside. You won’t have to break out the label maker or open multiple boxes to find what you need. Take your organization to the next level with these clear containers with colored lids. SPILL-PROOF PLASTIC CONTAINERS - Our clear storage containers are made of durable plastic with a secured vinyl lid to keep your items safely inside. The vinyl lid comes with a slit top to easily access the inside of your Viewtainer with a simple squeeze. The easy open lid will remain shut and keep all of your screws or ribbons inside even if it is tipped upside down or dropped. GIFT PACKAGED SET - This six-pack set of Viewtainers comes in a gift package with a variety of sizes. You receive 1 of each size: 2.75”x8”, 2”x7.75”, 2”x6”, 2”x4”, 2.75”x5”, and 2”x4”. This set comes with lids in a variety of pastel colors to help you color coordinate your tools, craft room, and storage closets. This set is a perfect gift for a new homeowner, parent, or handyman. ORGANIZE TOOLS, CRAFTS, AND TOYS - These versatile clear plastic storage containers make one part of life a little bit easier. We understand that the busy lives of craftsman, nurses, teachers, and even kids require a little help through organization. Organize the garage, classroom, bathroom, or crafts and hobbies so you can clearly see what you need and access it easily. MADE IN THE USA - All of Viewtainer’s storage containers and secure lids are made in the United States. We believe in creating high-quality products that you can trust to store your precious tools, hobbies, and crafts. Viewtainers are made to stand up to the drops that may occur in the workshop. The slit top will keep its shape even after repeated squeezes, so you can use it for every project.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iJREe55AL._AC_SL1226_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viewtainer","source_asin":"B0798ZTJSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0798ZTJSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0798ZTJSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
