window.products.push({"id":505168,"name":"Stainless Steel Taco Stand (2 PACK) – Restaurant Style Quality Taco Holder with Bonus Salsa Cup | 100% Dishwasher and Oven Safe | Great for Taco Tuesd","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K8rtgG3QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CinaStar is all about creating high-quality kitchen products and food truck accessories that make cooking fun and easy, from the casual home cook to the professional chef. Our metal taco holders are the best way to keep tacos from spilling over or falling on their side and look extra-sleek when paired with a stainless steel serving tray or metal food tray. Plus, you can enjoy all the guacamole your heart desires with our included sauce cup!  You can even use the taco plates with dividers as molds to make your own hard shell tacos! Just dip plain corn tortillas in oil, fry and flip them over the taco serving tray to cool into the perfect taco shells.Invite the squad over for a restaurant-style grubfest or impress the whole family by spicing up Taco Tuesday with stylish–yet super handy–taco bar serving dishes! Q: How do the taco stand up holders keep my tacos warm? A: Put the taco holder stand in the oven with your taco shells to keep them nice and toasty-warm. Q: How many tacos can each taco shell maker hold? A: Each taco maker can hold up to three mouthwatering tacos. They’re great for helping kids put together their own set of tacos without the mess! How to Make the Perfect Taco 1. Prepare shells with filling of your choice2. Add cooked ingredients and cheese, then warm the racks in the oven or on the grill.3. Add cool fillings like lettuce, tomatoes and guacamole right before eating. Enjoy! Who It’s For ✓ Anyone who loves Taco Tuesdays, weekend picnics and parties✓ Taco lovers of all kinds✓ Casual and professional cooks✓ Thoughtful gift givers What’s Included ✓ Two (2) stainless steel taco holders✓ One (1) bonus melamine sauce cup Hate the Sight of Lettuce, Tomatoes and Beef Strewn All Over the Place? Order your stainless steel taco serving set today–keep toppings in and mess out!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K8rtgG3QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CinaStar","source_asin":"B07H2Q1G4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H2Q1G4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H2Q1G4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
