window.products.push({"id":505190,"name":"FULI 100% Cotton Zippered Futon Cover, Japanese Futon Mattress Cover, Shikibuton, Made in Japan (Twin XL, Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vg6PrfvKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton FULI Original Zippered Futon Cover - Enjoy the unique soft touch of cotton. This is an elegant bed cover made with Japan's excellent dyeing and sewing technology. Size: Twin XL / Product Size: 41\" x 85\" x 0.05\" / Packing Size: 9.25\" x 13.00\" x 1.25\" / Shipping Weight: 1.5 lbs. / Thread Count: 205 Japanese made mattress covers to support a comfortable night's sleep - Cotton is a material well suited to the Japanese climate, where there are great variations between the four seasons. Spring and autumn experience intense variations in humidity, summer nights are as hot as in tropical climates, and the cold winters are characterized by heavy snowfall. That's why Japanese mattresses and covers, including our products, are made to help you stay cool in summer and warm in spring and autumn. Suitable for use in all seasons - Made from cotton, these sheets are highly absorbent and breathable, keeping you cool in summer, warm in winter, and helping you sleep comfortably all year round. Feels good on the skin and can be used in any season. Washable - Our sheets are fully machine washable. Repeated washes are unlikely to cause damage, and in fact make the fabric softer and even kinder to the skin. * Please avoid tumble drying as this will cause shrinkage. When washing, keep the sheets zipped up and put them in a laundry net. Failure to use a laundry net may cause damage. Excellent thermal properties - Cotton contains a lot of air between its fibers. Its hollow and naturally twisted fibers form many overlapping layers, creating air pockets that result in a soft, warm sheet. Comfortable springiness and feel - As a natural fiber, cotton has a mildly acidic pH, close to that of human skin. Therefore it does not irritate the skin of babies or people with sensitive skin, and has a pleasant springiness and a comfortable feel. Cotton's signature durability - After washing the sheet, sun drying will remove moisture and cause the fibers to shrink. This restores the sheet's original volume, allowing you to enjoy the cotton's warmth for a long period of time Material: 100% cotton fabric","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vg6PrfvKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FULI","source_asin":"B074THVWSG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074THVWSG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074THVWSG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
