window.products.push({"id":505241,"name":"Candumy Table Runner Gold (14x36Inch) 1 Piece Simulation Bauhinia Washable Placemats, Non Slip PVC Table Runners Holidays Parties Decor(Gold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jJkElWJrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Table Runner: 100% brand new and high quality Color: GOLD Weight: 0.44 lb Size: 14\"x36\" (35x 91CM) Pattern: Bauhinia Quantity: 1 PC Material composition: 100%PVC Heat protection: Up to 250 Fahrenheit degrees. Features: Hollow gilded Bauhinia pattern design, beautiful and practical table decoration. Protects Your Table Top:Table covers able to handle up to 250 Fahrenheit degrees of heat. Made of high quality environmentally PVC, Very durable, easy to clean, Non-fading,Non-stain, Non-mildew, Dry quickly. Can be washed directly with water, easy to wash and dry, no color drop, easy roll it up to store, can be recycled. Package： 1 x Table Runner Table Runner only, other accessories demo in the picture is not included! Notes: 1, Due to the light and screen setting difference, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures. 2, Please allow 1-3cm error due to manual measurement 3, No machine wash, hand wash in warm soapy water and wipe dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jJkElWJrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Candumy","source_asin":"B07Z1FB2TQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z1FB2TQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z1FB2TQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":505242,"name":"Marmont Hill Norman Rockwell Prints on Canvas Coming and Going Art Print, 24 by 24\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cDIscbmZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Coming and Going appeared on the cover of The Saturday Evening Post on August 30th, 1947.This was the artist's 248th painting to be featured on the cover of the Post. Going and Coming are two paintings painted on top of each other with coming on top of going. Rockwell with these two paintings convey both the spirit and the actuality of a day with the family on the lake. Norman Rockwell was one of America's leading artists. His subject was the story of the American dream, the detail of a simpler time, painted with warmth and humor. Showing the nostalgia of the American people with paintings that were often idyllic and expressed enthusiasm for the ordinary. In 1916, he created the first of 321 covers for The Saturday Evening Post. Rockwell's Americana images were loved by the public then and now but not always loved by critics. The artist created World War II posters garnering support for the war and received the Presidential Medal of Freedom. Our fine art prints from the Marmont Hill Art Collective display sharp, clear images. Our high quality reproduction allows you the best of both worlds: quality and affordability. Our art prints are: Professionally hand stretched Norman Rockwell art prints Gallery wrapped in sustainable, FSC certified wood Norman Rockwell prints arrive ready to hang All of our prints are made in the USA Includes a certificate of authenticity Multiples sizes available to fit your needs for any room At Marmont Hill Art Collective we have an extensive collection of Normal Rockwell's famous art prints in many categories that relate to family, life, love, Scouts of America, and of Rockwell's most well-known work. You are sure to find the exact art print to fit your decorating needs whether it be for your bedroom, bathroom or living room. Our sizes come in 18x18, 24x24, 32x32, 40x40 and 48x48. With so many sizes to choose from we have a size to fit any room.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cDIscbmZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marmont Hill","source_asin":"B01KLMO4E4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KLMO4E4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KLMO4E4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
