window.products.push({"id":505263,"name":"Artestia 12-in-1 Multi Cooker with Air Fry, Sous Vide, Rice, Sauté, Slow Cook, Steam, Roast, & Grill - Removable 6.5 QT Cooking Bowl, 12 Pre-Set Progr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":137.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X5M3irrwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【12 in 1 Slow Cooker and Air Fryer combo】 All functions in one cooker. The multipurpose cooker is also a slow cooker, air fryer, rice cooker, steamer, stew pot, yogurt maker, warmer and more.one machine can meet your all cooking needs, help you save space and money. 【Easy-to-Operate and Safety Features】 Touch the icon instead of keeping circling to choose cooking mode, quick and easy. 12 presets allow you to air-fry extra crispy chicken wings; air-fry rotisserie for savory pork roast, mouthwatering turkey breast.Equipped with non slip handles on both sides of the slow cooker, you can easily move it without getting burned. Built in overheat protection function automatically stops the machine when the temperature is too high to prolong the service life. 【Smokeless Technloy】 The virtually smoke Free with unique smoke control technology,so that you can effortlessly bring your outdoor cooking experience, indoors. This Smokeless Grill leaves your kitchen full of only appetising BBQ aromas instead of greasy smoke. A transparent glass lid for you to check the status of the food in the pan at any time. The other is a 1330W air fryer lid that heats the food from all angles to create a crispy texture. 【Time & Temp Control】 Under the Crockpot function, the adjustable time range is 30 minutes to 24 hours, so you can choose the appropriate time according to your taste. Put the ingredients in at night and wake up to a delicious breakfast in the morning, our slow cooker takes the time out of your busy schedule! 【 After-Sales worry-free】Artestia aims at offering our customers best products and best service all the time.Our countertop Electric Contact Grills comes with a 2-year warranty.If you have any question, please feel free to tell us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X5M3irrwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artestia","source_asin":"B08RNCX6QQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RNCX6QQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RNCX6QQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":505264,"name":"2PACK Mini Bag Sealer, Handheld Heat Vacuum Sealing Machine, 2 in 1 Heat Seal and Cutter Resealer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aRJkWJEiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"2 in 1 Heat Sealer and Cutter: Quickly seals and cuts. Mini bag sealer, a necessity for those who like snacks. The \"-\" side is a cutter, which can cut the plastic bags. The “+” side is a heat sealer, before using, you need to install 2*AA batteries, then press down the heating end for 3-5seconds to warm-up, simply slide it along the bag. After using, attach the hook and it will power off automatically. Keep Food Fresh: Seal all your food for airtight food storage with our mini heat sealer. With no need for worrying about containers leaking or opening which lead to a mess or food spoilage. Using our plastic bag sealer, you can re-use the original bag, lock in freshness and flavor. Seal Various Bags: Appropriated for various bags, Coated aluminum foil bags are recommended PP, PE, PVC bags with thickness no more than 0.3mm. Such as storage bags, potato chip bags, fruit bags, sugar bags. Easy to Use: Before using, you need to install 2*AA batteries, then press down the heating end for 3-5seconds to warm-up, then simply slide it along the edge of any bag and it's sealed airtight. And you can just press and pull the mini food cutter across the bag, you don’t need to use scissors anymore. To get better sealing effects, you can repeat the step several times. Compact & Portable: Featured with mini size, make the portable sealer easy to fit in your bag to carry out, wherever you are traveling, hiking, camping, or carrying on other activities. Suitable for different places at the home-like dining room, kitchen, balcony. It is available for cutting and sealing wherever you are and whatever you do.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aRJkWJEiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mempedont","source_asin":"B08V8KX5LK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V8KX5LK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V8KX5LK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
