window.products.push({"id":505344,"name":"Camera Lens Coffee Mug, Stainless Steel Leak-Proof Travel Mug, Keychain of Mini Camera Lens Mug and Camera Aperture, Camera Lens Cup Novelty Gift for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u2yUng9OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gift Set for Men- including a camera lens coffee mug, a keychain of mini camera lens mug, a keychain of camera lens with high quality package.The lens mug is a 1:1 replica of Lens EF 24-105mm f/4 IS USM Lens, the camera lens coffee mug looks like a genuine camera lens. Also perfect unique gift for father, boyfriend, ideal for photographers and videographer and so on. No Spill Coffee Mug with Magic Sucker- Your travel coffee mug is a real tumbler with magic sucker. Sucker designed on the bottom makes it a real tumbler cup. Just fix it on the table with smooth surface and you'll be worry free about knocking your coffee tea mug over again. The fully closed leak-proof lid is non-spill and will keep your coffee or beverages safe while it's hot. Portable and also perfect for airplane train travelers. Safe & Eco-friendly- The camera lens mug is made of food grade materials outside and premium-quality stainless steel inside, which is safe and environmental friendly for drinking. The outside is made of 100% BPA free and extra-fine stainless steel interior with 13.5 oz / 400 ml capacity when filled up. And the mini camera lens mug keychain is also made of ABS plastic and stainless steel. The camera lens keychain is made of alloy and glass material. Gift for any Occasion- Perfect for birthday, retirement, wedding, anniversary, housewares, housewarming gift, father's day, memorial day, best friend day, labor day, Christmas, thanksgiving day, black Friday, Cyber Monday, ny, new year, veterans day, valentine's day. Coffee gift ideas for him and for guys who have everything, groomsmen, stepfather, step dad, friends or coffee lovers men. Realistic lens cup is a must-have for any photographers,filmmakers, videographers or Photographers. Widely Use- If you're not one of those folks who loves wrapping both hands around a hot cup, you can still enjoy this fun coffee mug! Fill it up with cold drinks or smoothies, they'll stay nice and cool under the sealed lid. We are 100% confident you will love this product. But, if for any reason you're not completely satisfied please contact us immediately for a full refund or replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u2yUng9OL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Splonary","source_asin":"B09FF9VHG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FF9VHG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FF9VHG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":505345,"name":"Betterdecor Feng Shui Chinese Dragon Home Office Statue Figurines for Prosperity (with a Logo Gift Bag)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TWH05RhKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Dragon, which is the most potent symbol of Yang, is one of the four celestial animals in Feng Shui. It is regarded as the “Supreme Being” in comparison to all other worldly animals, because it can survive in any environment; the sea, the mountains and even the heavens. It is a mystical creature that has held emblem since ancient times, when it was believed to transfuse courage and heroism to the beholder. The Dragon can be positioned in a variety of ways around the home or office. According to Feng Shui experts, no matter where the Dragon is displayed, it will serve to defend the area, create confidence, attract wealth and stimulate the vibes of masculinity. To achieve all your goals with self-confidence and strength.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TWH05RhKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Betterdecor","source_asin":"B006TQ0XW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006TQ0XW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006TQ0XW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":505346,"name":"Mhdd Black Zebra Stripe Embroidered Throw Pillow Cover Soft White Chenille Decorative Cushion Sham for Sofa Couch Bedroom Lumbar 12x19 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813cfkM-pNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a chic cover up, which is suitable for decoration in the living room, bedroom, sofa, chair, etc.Well made and stylish. Color scheme of black and white, embroidery, warm and delicate. A few notes: 1, The embroidery pattern is made of glossy rayon. Compared with other parts, it is more likely to be worn. 2, A small amount of lining paper will remain on the inside of the pillowcase and will fall off after washing.It can be used normally. 3, Cut and sew by hand, pls allow 1 inch error in actual size. If you have any questions or suggestions, please contact us by email first. We will reply to you within 24 hours! Thank you for your choice!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813cfkM-pNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MHDD","source_asin":"B088LT6TM9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088LT6TM9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088LT6TM9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":505347,"name":"RIKON 10-320 14-Inch Band Saw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qKfHfkYgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Designed to give you options for cutting wood and non-ferrous materials, the RIKON 10-320 14-Inch Bandsaw offers a large, cast iron work table, ball-bearing blade guides, and a powerful motor with two speeds. With convenient features such as a quick-release table tilt, adjustment functions, and dust ports, this precision bandsaw also has options for a miter gauge, rip fence, and table inserts. 10-320 14-Inch BandsawAt a Glance: Two speeds offer a variety of cutting applications Two speeds offer a variety of cutting applications Large work table features quick-release tilt and provides plenty of workspace Large work table features quick-release tilt and provides plenty of workspace Edge-facing thrust bearings extend blade and bearing life and improve stability Edge-facing thrust bearings extend blade and bearing life and improve stability Dust-cleaning brush and dust ports keep machine and workspace clean Dust-cleaning brush and dust ports keep machine and workspace clean Optional rip fence and miter gauge for straight and angle cuts Optional rip fence and miter gauge for straight and angle cuts Two-year limited warranty Two-year limited warranty 14-inch bandsaw has large cast-iron work table. View larger . Industrial-strength motor, dust removal system, and cast iron wheels for uniform operation. View larger . Designed for Smooth, Uniform, Stable Performance The RIKON 14-Inch Bandsaw is driven by a 1-horsepower motor that functions smoothly and powerfully. Precision balanced, nine-spoke, cast iron wheels give the blade uniform operation, and it is evenly controlled with upper and lower ball-bearing guides. The edge-facing thrust bearings also help to extend blade and bearing life while improving the stability of the blade during cutting. Two Speeds for Different Cutting Applications With a 6-inch cutting capacity and two speed settings, the RIKON 14-Inch Bandsaw can be used for a variety of applications. The 1,445-feet/minute setting is ideal for hardwoods, some plastics, and non-ferrous metals, while the 2,950-feet/minute setting is used for other woodworking applications. Large Working Table for Added Convenience A large, 16-inch by 20-1/2-inch table provides plenty of additional work space during woodcutting operations. T-slots help with larger work pieces, and a micro-adjustable table trunnion helps you square the table to the back of the blade. Additionally, a quick-release table tilt that allows the table to quickly tilt in and out of its home position. Dust Collection System Keeps Area Clean The RIKON 14-Inch Bandsaw features a tire-cleaning brush that cleans the lower wheel as it spins, helping prevent sawdust buildup on the wheel and blade. The 2-1/2-inch and 4-inch dust ports help keep dust out of the machine and out of the air by making it easy to attach your dust-collection bag or system. Customize Your Work and Space With the optional miter gauge and rip fence, you can effectively perform straight or angle cuts. A convenient tool storage cabinet at the bottom of the unit gives you a place to keep extra blades, jigs, or other tools that you frequently use with your bandsaw. Easy to Assemble and Operate It's easy to assemble, operate, and adjust the RIKON 14-Inch Bandsaw with the helpful manual, blade selection guide, and wheel adjustment tip sheet. The RIKON 10-320 14-Inch Bandsaw is backed by a manufacturer's two-year limited warranty. What's in the Box RIKON 10-320 14-Inch Bandsaw, work table, base cabinet, owner's manual, and parts for assembly. From the Manufacturer Powerful 1-HP motor and dual blade speed allows for cutting various materials. The extra large table surface and two \"T\"-Slots provide ample support for those big jobs. Ball bearing blade guides for precision and accuracy. Balanced nine spoke cast wheels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qKfHfkYgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RIKON Power Tools","source_asin":"B002FB74UG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002FB74UG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002FB74UG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
