window.products.push({"id":505406,"name":"Vailge 3-Piece 100% Washed Cotton Duvet Cover, Ultra Soft Striped Duvet Cover Set, Breathable Duvet Cover with Zipper Closure, Easy Care Bedding Sets ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KeCNiHUXL._AC_SL1187_.jpg","description":"Detail Love lounging in those cushy, comfortable beds in upscale hotels? You can’t go wrong with a duvet in a classic stripe—especially in a serene elegant colors.The pattern is simple but soft enough to match the rest of your bedroom decor. Benefit from the duvet cover * Changing up the bedding can drastically change the style and feel of your bedroom.Best of all, if you can create a new bedroom atmosphere by only adding a new duvet cover it’s a win win!  * Made to last — and maximize your bed’s comfort — a good duvet cover gets softer with every wash. * Widely known for high standards of durability, strength and softness; the smooth finish of this exquisite duvet cover will make you feel like true royalty. Difference from other duvet covers * Material - Thickness of cloth is perfect for summer and winter time. After several special washed treatments, duvet cover will not fade nor shrink and will remain soft and comfy. * Design - The simple solid color design matches the duvet cover with various decoration style. * Easy-on, easy-off - Has a hidden zipper closure instead of pesky buttons.It also comes with four interior corner ties to keep the comforter inside snugly in place * Durability - The strong weave offers durability that can withstand long term use and hundreds of washes. * Gift - Ideal gift for birthdays, weddings and more. Specifications: - Color: White, Grey,Stripe - Product Size:Twin(68\" x 90\"),Queen(90\" x 90\"), King(104\" x 90\"),California King(104\" x 98\") - Pillow Shams Size: Twin(20\" x 26\"),Queen(20\" x 26\"), King(20\" x 36\"),California King(20\" x 36\") - Stripe Weight: Twin(2.65lb),Queen(3.30lb), King(3.75lb),California King(4.20lb) Package Contents: - 1 x duvet cover - 2 x pillow shams - 1 x storage bag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KeCNiHUXL._AC_SL1187_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vailge","source_asin":"B07Q1ZXWJN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q1ZXWJN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q1ZXWJN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
