window.products.push({"id":505498,"name":"Smart Design Master Solid Grip Shelf Liner - 18 Inch x 4 Feet - Non Adhesive, Strong Grip Bottom, Easy Clean Kitchen Drawer, Cabinet, Cupboard Dresser","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cr5dBhT8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smart Design Shelf Liners Shelf Liners cushion and protect your surfaces and home goods from everyday wear and tear.Our selection of colors and designs will add style and freshen up your shelves, drawers and closets. Package Includes Includes Master Grip Shelf Liner.For covering shelves, cabinets, closets, drawers, arts & crafts. Features and Benefits Easy to cut and apply with no adhesive to get in the way of application.Washable and wipes clean w/ a damp cloth. Product Specifications Roll Size: 18 Inches x 4 FeetColor: Multicolor SelectionsMaterial: Durable and Washable MaterialDesign: Non-Slip and Non-Adhesive Brand and Warranty Info People around the world live smarter with Smart Design, manufacturers of innovative, high-quality home and commercial organizational and laundry care products.Since 1970, Smart Design has set the standard of excellence in the Home Organization Industry by developing products that allow consumers to optimize their needs.Everything from your closet, kitchen, laundry room, home office, garage and auto to your workplace.Located in Southern California, Smart Design is a family-owned company with customer service at the core of our business.If you have any questions, issues, or concerns about your order, reach out to our Customer Service Team via email anytime, 24/7.Our Team will do their best to respond to all emails within 24 hours. Visit us online for phone support Monday-Friday 8 am – 5 pm PST.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cr5dBhT8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart Design","source_asin":"B092SY8NHT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092SY8NHT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092SY8NHT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":505499,"name":"LETAU Cordless Sliding Panels Track Blinds, 100% Blackout Made to Order Vertical Blinds for Large Windows, Sliding Doors, Open Spaces and Room Divider","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":76.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510JWyAewaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MOUNT TYPES: Inside mounted blinds require a minimum frame depth of 2.5\" for secure installation. If your window frame depth is less than 2.5\" please select outside mount. Outside mounts are often used when there is not sufficient frame depth for inside mounting. INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the inside frame width at three locations-the top,middle,and bottom. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number as your inside width when ordering. Step 2. Measure the height at 3 locations-the left,middle,and right side. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number as your inside height when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 8\" to be the outside mount width. Step 2. If your window is french window, measure from 2.4\" above the top window frame to the place 0.4\" above the ground. If your window is windowsill window, measure from 2.4\" above the top window frame to the place 4 \" below the bottom window frame. The overlap it recommended to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps. Material: 100% Blackout fabric, face and back same color, energy saving, thermal insulated, uv protection Versatile Uses: Best for french door, patio door, balcony door, closet door, sliding glass door, large picture window, room divider, and large windows. Made to Order: Each slidding panel blind is custom made, we can make exactly size to fit your window perfectly, width from 32inch to 114inch, length from 20-138inch. Panel Size and Quantity: Each Panels is about 20inch wide, there are 2, 4, 6, 8 panels for each blind depends on your window size. Take example, if your window width is 70inch wide, there will be 4 panels total, if your window is 100inch wide, there will be 6 panels total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510JWyAewaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LETAU","source_asin":"B0C488D6QK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C488D6QK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C488D6QK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
