window.products.push({"id":505538,"name":"Durable Magnetic Knife Holder For Wall- 16 Inch Genuine Walnut Wood Knife Magnetic Strip With Ultra Strong Magnetic Block For Secure Storage- Kitchen ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-bqc1+k9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Powerful Magnetic Knife Strip For Secure Hold: The Sweetman Innovations magnetic knife bar comes with state-of-the-art magnets strong enough to hold any knife. By providing easy access to your most-used knives and other kitchen utensils, this elegant knife holder is suitable for any home or professional kitchen! Genuine Walnut: Superior Quality and Elegant Look: Made from 100% Genuine Walnut Wood, this knife magnetic strip is the perfect combo of durable quality and timeless aesthetics. A chic yet minimal kitchen knife bar organizer blends with the décor of any Farmhouse, Modern, Retro, Industrial or Scandinavian style kitchen. Space-Saving Design To Fit In Any Kitchen: Our 16” magnetic knife organizer can effortlessly fit in any kitchen to bring order to your most-used knives and kitchen gadgets. A great way to keep your favorite knives within your arm’s reach, declutter your kitchen drawers, and keep your sharp knives away from kiddos! Versatile Magnetic Knife Rack Also For Tools, Art Supplies & More: This multipurpose magnetic storage organizer rack is ideal for your kitchen, but that’s not all. You can also use it in your garage or utility room to keep your metal tools in place, in your arts and crafts room to organize your art supplies, in your bathroom for your manicure supplies, and so much more! Easy To Clean And Install | Detailed Instructions Included: With two installation methods [extreme-hold double-sided tape or screws], you can effortlessly install your new magnetic knife holder strip in minutes. And the best part? All hardware, double-sided tape, and an enclosed QR code with an installation video are included. The knife rack easily detaches from the mounting plate for hassle-free cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-bqc1+k9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweetman Innovations","source_asin":"B08DDFY5RT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505538","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DDFY5RT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DDFY5RT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
