window.products.push({"id":505661,"name":"File Organizer for Recipes - Expanding Recipe File Folder Organizer with Dividers, Accordion Style Organizer for Recipe Cards, Clippings, Full Size Re","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EzTCoHmmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ACCORDION FILE ORGANIZER: Are your recipes a mess? Start collecting your favorite recipes in this expandable file folder. You won't have to sort through a box of crinkled, stained recipe cards in a box, just flip to the category of your choice. DOCUMENT FOLDER: Our multi-pocket folder measures 12 1/2\" wide x 10\" tall and 2 1/2\" deep. It has 8 tab dividers with different food categories for easy recipe sorting. The elastic closure keeps your folders, recipes, and grocery list contained. UNIQUE DESIGN: Enjoy a modern gray and metallic turquoise look on our paper file organizer. The expandable folder can hold hundreds of items, including recipe clippings, recipe cards, magazine clippings, and handwritten recipes. FAMILY RECIPE BOOK: Our organizer folder comes ready to help you create your own cookbook. Its the ideal starting point for putting all of your cooking papers in the proper place. It is perfect for curating a collection of family recipes for future generations. FANTASTIC GIFT: Our documents organizer is an excellent mother's day gift or cooking gift for your mom, aunt, friends, and anyone else who loves to collect recipes. Include a few of your own personal recipes in the expanding file folders for a truly unique and thoughtful present.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EzTCoHmmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meadowsweet Kitchens","source_asin":"B081FXJDL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081FXJDL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081FXJDL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":505662,"name":"DeLonghi SafeHeat BBH100 Baseboard Heater","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31NSFXSP4TL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description DeLonghi Features - SAFEHEAT Baseboard Heater Features a unique foot switch for easy operation.* Maximum Heat Flow - Advanced X-shaped element heats air twice for faster more efficient heating than conventional baseboard heaters. * Adjustable Thermostat - Super-sensitive adjustable thermostat provides energy-efficient operation by letting you adjust the heat as you want it.* Side-To-Side Safety Shut-Off - Automatically turns the unit off should the unit become overheated even if only partially obstructed. Safety with complete peace of mind. * Perfect For Any Room - Whether in the bedroom living room or office the SafeHeat baseboard heater provides fast and flexible heating for the entire room.* Foot Switch with 3 Heat Settings - Easily operate the on / off switch and heat settings without bending over. Choose from HI (1500 watts) MED (900 watts) or LO (600 watts) for just the right amount of heat.* Anti-Freeze Setting - For minimal heat temperature so you never get bitter cold again. The unit will automatically turn itself on when the temperature reaches 44 degrees Fahrenheit.* Designed and Engineered in Italy. Amazon.com When the weather outside turns frigid, stay warm and cozy indoors with the aid of this baseboard heater from Italian appliance specialist DeLonghi. The 120-volt heater spreads heat throughout a room in half the time needed by other baseboard heaters and works as a cost-effective alternative to a household heating system in small rooms. In particularly cold weather, the quiet heater complements a central heat system, bringing comforting heat to corners of high activity while the main system runs on low power for greater energy conservation. DeLonghi constructed the baseboard heater in rustproof metal for even heat distribution and resilience. The heating element features an x-shaped design and does not glow. To turn on the heater, users avoid bending over with an ergonomic foot switch. Three power settings allow flexibility for diverse rooms and personal heating needs. For energy efficiency, the heater runs low at 600 watts or medium at 900 watts to slowly spread warmth. On high at 1500 watts, the unit brings full heat to a room with extra speed. Users select their ideal comfort temperature with an adjustable thermostat. After reaching this temperature, the heater continues to sense the room's current heat and reacts accordingly to maintain the comfort level. An antifreeze function engages should the indoor temperature fall below 44 degrees F, while the heater also automatically shuts off upon knock-over or overheating. The stable unit connects to outlets with its 3-foot power cord. DeLonghi advises against placing the heater outdoors or near flammables. Thorough safety guidelines and instructions are included. A limited 90-day warranty covers this item. The baseboard heater measures 47-1/4 by 4-1/3 by 10-1/2 inches and weighs 13 pounds upon shipping --Jessica Reuling From the Manufacturer Features: The safety shut-off automatically turns the unit off in case of overheating even if the grid is only partially obstructed The safety shut-off automatically turns the unit off in case of overheating even if the grid is only partially obstructed The advanced x-shaped non-glowing heating element heats air twice for faster, more efficient heating than conventional baseboard heaters The advanced x-shaped non-glowing heating element heats air twice for faster, more efficient heating than conventional baseboard heaters Supersensitive adjustable room thermostat lets you adjust, select and maintain the desired temperature, and provides energy-efficient operation Supersensitive adjustable room thermostat lets you adjust, select and maintain the desired temperature, and provides energy-efficient operation 3 heat settings: 750-watt, 1250-watt, and 2000-watt 3 heat settings: 750-watt, 1250-watt, and 2000-watt Anti-frost function. Anti-frost function. New ergonomic controls: comfortable foot switches with functioning indicator lights and easy-access thermostat New ergonomic controls: comfortable foot switches with functioning indicator lights and easy-access thermostat See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31NSFXSP4TL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"De'Longhi","source_asin":"B0000638TW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000638TW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000638TW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
