window.products.push({"id":505849,"name":"Brother Designio Series DZ1500F High Speed Straight Stitch Sewing Machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5112e-ImRbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Designio™ Series DZ1500F High Speed Straight Stitch Sewing Machine Great for Garment Construction, Quilting and Needle Felting Introducing the Designio™ DZ1500F, a high speed, straight stitch sewing machine designed for the designer in you. You’ll love having a heavy duty, semi-industrial sewing machine that can sew up to a lightning fast 1,500 stitches per minute. Quilting, garment construction and even simple repairs can be accomplished quickly and easily. Utilizing a unique pin feed system the DZ1500F keeps your projects perfectly in place while feeding your layered material evenly and smoothly. Achieve professional high speed straight stitching results at your fingertips! For the artist, the DZ1500F offers a very unique feature -- Needle Felting. Just connect the included attachment and you can be ready to create sewn art in no time. The DZ1500F even comes with a yarn roving kit to get you started. Dream up your creation, and bring it to life on this extremely affordable, yet feature-packed, machine! Added Value Package – More than a $150 Value! Up to 1,500 Stitches Per Minute Brother™-Exclusive Pin-Feed Mechanism The DZ1500F includes a Needle Felting Attachment to create beautiful, high-end textured embellishments (with or without wool roving). Save time when sewing up to 1,500 stitches per minute to create professional-level fashions with ease. Moves several layers of fabrics simultaneously for sewing accuracy. 4 Color-Coded Levels of Feed Dog Adjustment and Presser Foot Pressure For visible and maximum fabric control and smooth feeding of material virtually every time. Knee Lifter for Quilting and Garment Construction Gives you the ability to lift the presser foot using the knee lifter. This frees your hands in order to turn your projects. Automatic Thread Cutter Automatically cut the upper and lower thread with ease. Extra-Large Extension Table with Bobbin Case Opening Helps you manage those large projects. Easy access point eliminates the need to remove table to replace oversized metal bobbin. On-board Fabric Separator Tool Easily sew seams in contrasting fabrics without puckering. Dual Thread Stand Keep 2 thread spools ready with on-board thread stand; use thread spool extender for quick and consistent threading. Make a fashion statement! The DZ1500F is designed for the designer in you so you can enjoy creating clothing and accessories that truly match your style. Enjoy heavy duty garment construction at speeds you won’t believe. Easily customize a wide range of fabric surfaces or create beautiful surface embellishment on fabric with wool roving or yarns in the included Needle Felting Attachment. Whether you are looking for high speed utility sewing/quilting or craft capabilities, the DZ1500F is an outstanding addition to your sewing room! Re-fashion your wardrobe! A great way to start sewing is to re-fashion items in your own closet. Have fun combining fabrics and textures, and transform clothes you rarely wear into 'front of the closet' favorites. Instead of spending money on alterations, see how easy it is to hem a pair of pants, or take in a seam yourself. The DZ1500F comes complete with a full set of designer accessories including:  • Extra-large extension table – Perfect for gowns and all your glamorous runway looks  • Adjustable zipper/piping foot - For easier attachment of fashion zippers and piping tapes  • Needle Felting Attachment – Create woven art, plus the DZ1500F includes a yarn roving kit to get you started! About Brother International Corporation Brother International Corporation has earned its reputation as a leading supplier of innovative products for home sewing and embroidery enthusiasts. The company is recognized for its high-quality, state-of-the-art machines and accessories, offering ease of use and flexibility at affordable prices. Brother is a wholly owned subsidiary of Brother Industries Ltd. In the box • DZ15000F straight stitch sewing machine • Extra-large extension table  • Protective case  • Fabric separator set  • Feed pin kit  • Knee lifter  • Large spool cap (2)  • Small screwdriver  • Large screwdriver  • Foot controller  • Seam/cloth guide  • Cleaning brush  • Needle set (6)  • Metal bobbins (5 plus 1 on machine)  • Accessory feet:  o Straight Stitch foot (on machine)  o Adjustable Zipper Piping foot  o Free-Motion Quilting foot o ¼ Inch Quilting foot  o Invisible Zipper foot  o Narrow Hemmer foot o Needle Felting Attachment  • Power cord  • English/Spanish operation manual  • 25 year limited warranty   PRODUCT COMPARISON CHART   Model Number DZ2400 DZ2750 DZ3000 DZ1234 DZ1500F DZ820E BASIC FEATURES   LCD Display Size 0.8\" x 2.2\" 1.1\" x 2.5\" 1.1\" x 2.5\" — — 1.4\" x 2.7\" Stitch Select • • • — • Touch Panel Lighting 1 LED 1 LED 1 LED 1 LED 1 LED 2 LEDs Thread Tension — — — Upper Dial Type Manual Automatic Needle Threading System Advanced Advanced Advanced — Automatic Automatic F.A.S.T. Bobbin Winding System • • • — • — Automatic Thread Cutter — — — — — • Quick-Set™","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5112e-ImRbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brother","source_asin":"B00EJW5RHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505849","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EJW5RHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EJW5RHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
