window.products.push({"id":505878,"name":"Air Fryer Parchment Paper Liners - 100PCS 6.3\" Disposable Cooking Non-Stick Liner, White Round Without Hole Baking Roasting Paper for Air Fryer, Micro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qie3rfghL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Healthy & reliable material: Air fryer liner parchment paper is made from unbleached pure wood pulp with food-grade silicone coating and strict quality standards, waterproof and non-stick. High temperature resistance up to 450 degrees Fahrenheit, perfect to protect your food from damage, ensure food safety and taste. Unique design: Our disposable parchment liner is designed in the shape of a round bowl, which can be put in when cooking, but also easy to take out food. The 4.5cm high edge design protects the sides of the air fryer and prevents juices and crumbs from falling on the bottom. Keep the air fryer clean: Disposable air fryer parchment paper are waterproof and oil-proof, and are a great way to isolate oil stains and remove food from the fryer. The air fryer is easy to clean after use and will help you to get rid of the trouble of cleaning. Protects the internal structure and extends the service life of the air fryer. Wide application: Air fryer parchment paper liner is resistant to heat, water and oil, suitable for air fryer, microwave oven, oven, frying pan, steamer, baking etc. Enjoy your delicious food at home baking, camping, barbecues, and parties! WARM PROMPT: Do not add air fryer liners while the air fryer is in preheat mode. After the air fryer is preheated, add paper and food. Preheating will produce strong hot air, do not let the paper contact the heating tube, otherwise there will be the so-called paper burning situation. Unbleached air fryer liners are disposable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qie3rfghL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gyothrig","source_asin":"B09NY4LGPH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-505878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NY4LGPH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NY4LGPH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
